# Projects Directory

This is where your actual PM work goes.

Create a folder for each project/feature you're working on:

projects/
├── ai-chat-feature/
│   ├── prd.md
│   ├── impact-estimate.md
│   ├── experiment-results.csv
│   └── strategy.md
├── activation-improvement/
│   ├── problem-analysis.md
│   ├── user-survey-data.csv
│   └── roi-scenarios.md
└── ...

Each project folder can contain:
- PRDs and specifications
- Data files (CSV, JSON)
- Analysis documents
- Strategy documents
- Research findings
